2,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to start by understanding the actual scope of this year’s development allocation before we discuss any specific programs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Scope is irrelevant if the outcome is invisible. I want to know what our previous initiatives actually achieved for patients.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m curious how any new program would fit into the current staffing levels, especially with the existing roster pressures.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m mostly worried about whether the hospital can physically absorb another program without the rooms and booking systems seizing up.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’ve seen good ideas crumble in year two when the people who promised support quietly stepped back.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, I hear you, but we must first know what we can afford to build before we judge past outcomes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, affordability is a constraint, not a justification for repeating failures. We need evidence of impact first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, @Shion, I agree with both. We need to know the budget limits and the staffing reality before we can judge any program’s feasibility.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, exactly. If the rooms and booking screens are already full, adding another program just creates a bottleneck.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, the physical space is only half the story. I worry more about the people who will actually keep it running when the novelty wears off.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a fair point. I will look into the ledger to see exactly what we can build, and the booking system to understand our current capacity.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, I will examine the readmission figures from the call-back trial and the booking system records to see what actually stuck.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, I will review the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing records to see where the pressure really sits.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Kenji, I will check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records to see if we have any physical slack left.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I will check the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries to see where support failed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Thank you all. I will review the ledger and the booking system records to ground our discussion in actual capacity and cost.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will review the readmission figures and the booking system records to determine if past efforts left any measurable trace.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will review the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review to understand where the pressure really sits.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I will review the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review to understand where the pressure really sits.""}]}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I will check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records to see if we have any physical slack left.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries to see where support failed.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
